        "text": "=🚀 New Content Repurposing Request Completed\n\nA new content submission has been processed and is ready for review.\n\n📌 Title: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Content Title'] }}\n🎯 Audience: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Target Audience'] }}\n🎨 Tone: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Content Tone'] }}\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nLinkedIn Post\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{ $json.linkedin_content }}\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nX Post\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{ $json.x_content }}\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nNewsletter Teaser\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{ $json.newsletter_content }}\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n\n📋 Status: Pending Review\n\nPlease review and approve before scheduling for publication.\n",
        "otherOptions": {
